  * feat(search): remove the "skim" engine (#3825)
   - Remove the "skim" engine in favor of "daemon-fuzzy". If somemone has
   - `search_mode = "skim"`, this PR will fall back to "fuzzy" but show a
   - warning in the interactive search UI encouraging the user to switch to
   - daemon-fuzzy.
   - This PR also changes the text of `atuin search --help` very slightly:
   - previously, we accepted both `fulltext` and `full-text` as search modes,
   - but listed `full-text` as the canonical spelling in the help message.
   - This PR changes the canonical spelling to `fulltext` while still
   - accepting both variants. The reasoning for this is that `fulltext` is
   - the only valid spelling in config.toml.
   - <img width="2654" height="1300" alt="skim-warning"
   - src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3db6f1d2-1b84-410c-a040-85300db35046"
   - />
