  * chore: add `OrFilter` as a replacement for `Vec`s as filter lists (#3768)
   - In several parts of the code, we use `Vec`s as filters, where the filter
   - allows an item if it matches any element of the `Vec`, or if the `Vec`
   - is empty, all items are allowed.
   - These semantics are not obvious from the type, particularly the empty
   - `Vec` meaning "allow all". This PR adds a new type, `OrFilter`, with
   - exactly these semantics. As a benefit, it also has O(log n) lookups
   - instead of O(n).
  * feat(config): validate new settings in `atuin config set` before writing them to disk (#3769)
   - Currently, `atuin config set` doesn't verify that the new settings can
   - actually be deserialized, which means you can easily break your
   - configuration in a way that `atuin config set` can't fix, because all
   - `atuin` subcommands require a valid config.
   - This PR validates the new settings before actually writing them to disk.
  * ci: run CodSpeed benchmarks on macro runners in walltime mode (#3786)
   - <!-- Thank you for making a PR! Bug fixes are always welcome, but if
   - you're adding a new feature or changing an existing one, we'd really
